Retrocycles RCL client and server
=================================

Retrocycles League's modern, protocol-compatible Armagetron Advanced
distribution. The `main` branch contains the player client and RCL dedicated
server on the established **sty+ct+ap** gameplay baseline.

Current release line: 0.2.9+sty+ct+ap+rcl.

Start with README-RCL.md for build instructions and RCL changes,
docs/CLIENT_BETA.md for player packages, and README-DEVELOPER for the upstream
engine build guide.

This fork remains licensed under the GNU GPL; see COPYING.txt.
